{"parse":{"title":"特性/荒野盟约","pageid":7339,"revid":17906,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E8%8D%92%E9%87%8E%E7%9B%9F%E7%BA%A6&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E8%8D%92%E9%87%8E%E7%9B%9F%E7%BA%A6&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E8%8D%92%E9%87%8E%E7%9B%9F%E7%BA%A6&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>荒野盟约</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.8D.92.E9.87.8E.E7.9B.9F.E7.BA.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"荒野盟约\"><b>荒野盟约</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 荒野盟约.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fb/g3gelcl54etfzqbzgylg9gu3dmemhp3.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E8%8D%92%E9%87%8E%E7%9B%9F%E7%BA%A6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fb/g3gelcl54etfzqbzgylg9gu3dmemhp3.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E8%8D%92%E9%87%8E%E7%9B%9F%E7%BA%A6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/fb/g3gelcl54etfzqbzgylg9gu3dmemhp3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />荒野盟约\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦战斗开始时、每被攻击<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>次时，在自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内随机空地，召唤[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">金狮战士</span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">金狮弓手</span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">金狮投枪手</span>]各1名，继承自身<font color=\"#58cb48\">5%</font>生命值，每回合最多生效<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />✦拥有落水救星，触发时损失<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>生命值。<br />✦自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内存在<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>名及以上友军时，最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%A5%AD%E5%8F%B8\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/自然祭司\"><img alt=\"自然祭司 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9c/7rf3vx13gc26qinhu92x7ha7j1m5wp5.png/75px-%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%A5%AD%E5%8F%B8_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9c/7rf3vx13gc26qinhu92x7ha7j1m5wp5.png/113px-%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%A5%AD%E5%8F%B8_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9c/7rf3vx13gc26qinhu92x7ha7j1m5wp5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-fi